# Penrose Wallpaper in Cursor

`AGENTS.md` at the repository root is authority, including its Commands section
and its type-policy and evidence rules. Do not duplicate them here.

## Cursor surfaces in this repo

- MCP: this repository declares no project server of its own, so there is no
  `.cursor/mcp.json`. Global servers come from `~/.cursor/mcp.json`.
- CLI: `.cursor/cli.json` — allow npm / node, the `tools/` verify and native
  build scripts, `scripts/verify-apk.sh`, and python3 / bash / git / gh. Deny
  writes under `.cursor/`, `.claude/`, and `.local/`.
- Auto-run: `.cursor/permissions.json`.
- Verifier subagent: `.cursor/agents/verifier.md` — the fast
  typecheck/policy/build loop plus the touched verify targets.
  `npm run quality:local` is the full gate and runs only on request.

## Skills

Project skills load from `.agents/skills/` (`.claude/skills` is a symlink to
the same directory), wired by `../mcp-servers/scripts/wire-repo-skills.sh`.
